1
00:00:00,126 --> 00:00:01,426
(Sheldon:)It's nice, huh?

2
00:00:01,627 --> 00:00:03,287
(Sheldon:)I got him for 20 bucks on eBay.

3
00:00:03,496 --> 00:00:05,796
(Sheldon:)Including the shipping.

4
00:00:08,968 --> 00:00:11,838
(Arthur:)I'm awake, right?

5
00:00:14,974 --> 00:00:17,674
(Arthur:)This is happening?

6
00:00:20,046 --> 00:00:22,846
- Cinnamon!
- Cinnamon!

7
00:00:23,215 --> 00:00:26,815
(Bernadette:)You know, maybe she doesn't recognize
her name because of Raj's accent.

8
00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:28,740
(Howard:)Good thinking.

9
00:00:28,921 --> 00:00:32,051
(Howard:)Cinnamon, come to Daddy.

10
00:00:33,559 --> 00:00:37,049
(Bernadette(likewise):)Cinnamon, where are you, my little lamb chop?

11
00:00:38,431 --> 00:00:40,831
- Nice. Heh.
- Thanks.

12
00:00:41,033 --> 00:00:43,193
(Howard:)When this all blows over,
remember that voice.

13
00:00:43,436 --> 00:00:45,696
It's kind of a turn-on. Heh.

14
00:00:47,073 --> 00:00:49,203
(Bernadette:)It turns you on when I sound like Raj?

15
00:00:52,545 --> 00:00:55,075
(Bernadette:)Cinnamon!

16
00:00:56,849 --> 00:01:01,049
Okay, as I put the egg on top...

